    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, My Friend! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take A Look Around...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another locked room, a sight you're all too familiar with. They call you the &quot;Escape Master&quot;, simply because your escape skills are nothing short of extraordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room is a brand-new puzzle. You\u2019ll untangle every thread, remove every obstacle, until you stand on a stage surrounded by applause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s not the end \u2014 not even close, and you know it. There\u2019s a door, one that's not part of the plan. It flickers in and out of view, appearing in every dream you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re getting closer to it. Every victory, every honor, is just another step toward that door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must open it, because... there\u2019s no door in this world you can\u2019t unlock.<br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape Room Strategy Guide:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy a Fun Time Solving Puzzles Together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look: What does the room look like? How many doors are there? Are the doors locked?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen: Tick-tock\u2026 How much time is left? What did the host say? Where are the clues to solve the puzzle?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch: How tall is that door? How does it feel ? Touch is a magic. Let your senses break through. The truth has always been right in the front of us. But with only eyes, we're always marching forward in eternal darkness.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop: Slow down, then again, make it slower.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't chase after mysteries, the mystery of the world is not a competition of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lord asks; The Lord answers. It's the Mystery; It's the Answer. It's the Gate to the Truth; It's the Key to the Truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah\u2026 that Key has always been on the door. Can you not see it? Can you glimpse it too? The light of truth behind layers of puzzles?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The Ultimate Gate&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soul-searching journey of an escape room master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine, Analyze, then Solve the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So simple, so beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S.: This game is highly challenging, perfect for experts looking for a tough challenge!</p>",
