ion of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lord asks; The Lord answers. It's the Mystery; It's the Answer. It's the Gate to the Truth; It's the Key to the Truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah\u2026 that Key has always been on the door. Can you not see it? Can you glimpse it too? The light of truth behind layers of puzzles?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;The Ultimate Gate&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soul-searching journey of an escape room master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine, Analyze, then Solve the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So simple, so beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P.S.: This game is highly challenging, perfect for experts looking for a tough challenge!</p>",
    "short_description": "Look around\u2026 there's a door. Light outside; inside, You await. Obviously, it's a room. A lock on the door, and a key to find, no doubt that's the rule. A door, a room, a lock, a key, and most importantly - You. What are you waiting for? It's the time to ESCAPE! Isn\u2019t that the TRUTH you seek for?",
